px;">Product Overview: AP Boots 9303 - Sepatu Boot PVC - 38</h3>\n        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 12px;">\n            The <strong>AP Boots 9303 - Sepatu Boot PVC - 38</strong> is precision-engineered for industrial durability, safety, and all-day comfort. Manufactured utilizing high-pressure single-injection molding technology, this footwear provides 100% leak-proof protection against water, mud, mild chemicals, and abrasive surfaces. Ideal for high-demand B2B applications worldwide.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- KEY ADVANTAGES -->\n    <div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;">\n        <h4 style="margin: 0 0 14px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1e3a8a;">Key Product Advantages & Features</h4>\n        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #334155;">\n            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>100% Seamless Waterproof:</strong> One-piece injection molded construction eliminates seams to guarantee total water impermeability.</li>\n            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Anti-Slip Traction Outsole:</strong> Deep lug tread design delivers aggressive grip on mud, wet tile, oily floors, and uneven terrains.</li>\n            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Ergonomic Flex-Comfort:</strong> Specially formulated flexible PVC compound moves naturally with foot biomechanics to reduce fatigue during extended work shifts.</li>\n            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Extreme Weather & Chemical Resistance:</strong> Resistant to UV degradation, acids, alkalis, oils, and agricultural fertilizers.</li>\n            <li style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>OEM / ODM Customization:</strong> Custom branding, color schemes, labeling, and carton packaging available for bulk export orders.</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION MATRIX -->\n    <div style="margin-bottom: 24px;"