Semesta (HOTS Trading) | Genuine Indonesian Direct Footwear B2B Supplier</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- PRODUCT OVERVIEW -->\n    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">\n        <h3 style="font-size: 16.5px; color: #0f172a; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding-left: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Product Overview: AP MEDIC Blue Protective Medical Work Clogs for Malaysia Healthcare Hospital Bulk</h3>\n        <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 10px;">\n            The <strong>AP MEDIC Blue Protective Medical Work Clogs for Malaysia Healthcare Hospital Bulk</strong> (Model Ref: <code>APB-035</code>) is engineered for demanding commercial, industrial, and agricultural working conditions. Built using precision injection molding technology, this footwear delivers 100% seamless waterproof protection, exceptional tear resistance, and anatomical foot support for intensive duty cycles.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SECTION 7: SOURCE & DESTINATION COUNTRY LOGISTICS -->\n    <div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 18px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #334155;">\n        <h4 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #0f172a; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">\n            <span>🌏</span> Source Origin & Export Supply Logistics (Section 7 Strategy)\n        </h4>\n        <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">• <strong>Source Origin:</strong> Genuine AP Boots® manufactured in Indonesia. Direct export loading via Tanjung Priok Seaport (Jakarta) and Tanjung Perak Seaport (Surabaya).</p>\n        <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">• <strong>Target Destination Market:</strong> Malaysia. Shipped directly from Indonesia to international import hubs, regional distribution centers, and commercial project sites.</p>\n        <p style="margin: 0; color: #475569; font-style: italic;">• <strong>Compliance & Documentation Notice:</strong> Destination country specific compliance s