(101, 'APB-101', '2018 Ultraflex Green', '10000049124422', 'AP Boots 2018 Ultraflex Green PVC Rain Boots Waterproof Flexible Mid-Calf for Construction Agriculture Bulk', 'Shoes & Accessories > Men\'s Shoes > Boots', 'AP Classic Boots', 'flexible rain boots, ultraflex rubber boots, agricultural plantation wellingtons, waterproof pvc boots, work wellies', 'https://p16-images-comn-sg.tokopedia-static.net/tos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg/afacc102d0cd4784b7b6fc6929b02eb2~tplv-aphluv4xwc-white-pad-v1:1600:1600.jpeg', 'https://p16-images-comn-sg.tokopedia-static.net/tos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg/img/hDjmkQ/2022/12/22/19813733-f4ec-4dc2-b909-c28827961496.jpg~tplv-aphluv4xwc-resize-jpeg:1600:1600.jpeg', 'https://p16-images-comn-sg.tokopedia-static.net/tos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg/img/hDjmkQ/2022/12/22/82805c71-1e82-459f-b26b-c47e084c653a.jpg~tplv-aphluv4xwc-resize-jpeg:1600:1600.jpeg', 'https://p16-images-comn-sg.tokopedia-static.net/tos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg/img/hDjmkQ/2022/12/22/6e428ff1-7ebc-4f77-bbf2-c91b37f10152.jpg~tplv-aphluv4xwc-resize-jpeg:1600:1600.jpeg', 'https://p16-images-comn-sg.tokopedia-static.net/tos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg/img/hDjmkQ/2022/12/22/b8973309-2ded-486c-b327-2881dda3524d.jpg~tplv-aphluv4xwc-resize-jpeg:1600:1600.jpeg', '', '<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;">\n    <!-- HEADER BRANDING -->\n    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a, #0284c7); color: #ffffff; padding: 24px 28px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px;">\n        <h2 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">AP BOOTS® — OFFICIAL GOLD SUPPLIER EXPORT LISTING</h2>\n        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.95;">Indonesia\'s Leading Manufacturer of Heavy-Duty Protective Waterproof Footwear | SNI & International Standards Certified</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- PRODUCT TITLE & OVERVIEW -->\n    <div style="margin-bottom: 24px;">\n        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: #0f172a; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding-left: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Product Overview: AP Boots 2018 Ultraflex Hijau - Sepatu Boot PVC - 39</h3>\n        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 12px;">\n            The <strong>AP Boots 2018 Ultraflex Hijau - Sepatu Boot PVC - 39</strong> is precision-engineered for industrial durability, safety, and all-day comfort. Manufactured utilizing high-pressure single-injection molding technology, this footwear provides 100% leak-proof protection against water, mud, mild chemicals, and abrasive surfaces. Ideal for high-demand B2B applications worldwide.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- KEY ADVANTAGES -->\n    <div style="background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;">\n        <h4 style="margin: 0 0 14px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1e3a8a;">Key Product Advantages & Features</h4>\n        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #334155;">\n            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>100% Seamless Waterproof:</strong> One-piece injection molded construction eliminates seams to guarantee total water impermeability.</li>\n            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Anti-Slip Traction Outsole:</strong> Deep lug tread design delivers aggressive grip on mud, wet tile, oily floors, and uneven terrains.</li>\n            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Ergonomic Flex-Comfort:</strong> Specially formulated flexible PVC compound moves naturally with foot biomechanics to reduce fatigue during extended work shifts.</li>\n            <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Extreme Weather & Chemical Resistance:</strong> Resistant to UV degradation, acids, alkalis, oils, and agricultural fertilizers.</li>\n            <li style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>OEM / ODM Customization:</strong> Custom branding, color schemes, labeling, and carton packaging available for bulk e