('1105', 'APB-MG-02-V5', 'APB-MG-02', 'AP Metaguard Black', '5', 'Fishery & Seafood', 'AP Boots AP Metaguard Black Fishery Seafood Processing Boots Waterproof Anti Slip Non Marking', 'Safety Footwear', 'AP Boots', 'Surabaya, Indonesia', 'High-Quality PVC / Synthetic Rubber Blend', 'Nitrile Rubber (Oil & Chemical Resistant)', '200J Steel Toe Cap', 'Mid-Calf', 'Black, Yellow, Green, White', 'EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)', '100% Waterproof, Saltwater Resistant, Non-Marking Sole, Anti Slip, Easy Clean', 'Seafood Processing Plant, Aquaculture Hatchery, Marine Cold Storage, Commercial Fishing', 'fishery processing boots', 'seafood plant wellingtons', 'waterproof aquaculture boots', 'marine cold storage boots, non marking anti slip wellingtons, commercial fishing boots supplier, saltwater resistant rubber boots', 60, 17.25, 14.25, 12.0, 12, '60 x 40 x 40 cm', 18.5, 0.096, 'Surabaya, Indonesia', '7 - 14 Days', '<div class="product-description-container">\n<h2>AP Boots AP Metaguard Black Fishery Seafood Processing Boots Waterproof Anti Slip Non Marking</h2>\n<p><strong>Product Purpose & Overview:</strong> Ideal for seafood processing plants, aquaculture hatcheries, cold storage facilities, and marine environments. 100% waterproof single-injection molding prevents liquid ingress, while specialized outsole grips wet tiles and slippery surfaces.</p>\n<h3>Key Features & Industry Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Application Focus:</strong> Specifically tailored for Seafood Processing Plant, Aquaculture Hatchery, Marine Cold Storage, Commercial Fishing.</li>\n    <li><strong>Material & Construction:</strong> Molded from High-Quality PVC / Synthetic Rubber Blend using seamless single-injection technology to guarantee 100% leak-proof reliability.</li>\n    <li><strong>Safety & Outsole:</strong> Features Nitrile Rubber (Oil & Chemical Resistant) with 100% Waterproof, Saltwater Resistant, Non-Marking Sole, Anti Slip, Easy Clean.</li>\n    <li><strong>Toe Protection:<