('1190', 'APB-GR-02-V10', 'APB-GR-02', '2005 + MOTIF', '10', 'All-Weather Rain Utility', 'AP Boots 2005 + MOTIF All Weather Rain Outdoor Utility Boots Waterproof Anti Slip', 'Safety Footwear', 'AP Boots', 'Surabaya, Indonesia', 'High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer', 'High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC', 'Soft Toe', 'High-Cut / Knee-High', 'Black, Yellow, Green, White', 'EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)', '100% Leak-Proof, Durable Polymer, Easy Cleaning, All Seasons, Flexible', 'General Utility, Municipal Works, Landscaping, Extreme Monsoon Rain Weather', 'all weather rain boots', 'outdoor utility wellingtons', 'waterproof monsoon boots', 'municipal maintenance rain boots, landscaping outdoor wellingtons, durable monsoon rubber boots, all season utility footwear', 60, 5.75, 4.75, 4.0, 12, '60 x 40 x 40 cm', 12.0, 0.096, 'Surabaya, Indonesia', '7 - 14 Days', '<div class="product-description-container">\n<h2>AP Boots 2005 + MOTIF All Weather Rain Outdoor Utility Boots Waterproof Anti Slip</h2>\n<p><strong>Product Purpose & Overview:</strong> Versatile all-weather utility footwear for municipal maintenance, flood response, landscaping, and outdoor work during heavy monsoon rains. Single-injection molded from premium PVC polymer for maximum longevity and zero seam failure.</p>\n<h3>Key Features & Industry Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Application Focus:</strong> Specifically tailored for General Utility, Municipal Works, Landscaping, Extreme Monsoon Rain Weather.</li>\n    <li><strong>Material & Construction:</strong> Molded from High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer using seamless single-injection technology to guarantee 100% leak-proof reliability.</li>\n    <li><strong>Safety & Outsole:</strong> Features High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC with 100% Leak-Proof, Durable Polymer, Easy Cleaning, All Seasons, Flexible.</li>\n    <li><strong>Toe Protection:</strong> Equipped with Soft Toe for safety against physical hazards.</li>\n    <li><strong>Hygiene & Comfort:</strong> Ergono