('1211', 'APB-GR-06-V1', 'APB-GR-06', '2017 GREEN LIME', '1', 'Oil & Gas Refinery', 'AP Boots 2017 GREEN LIME Oil Gas Refinery Heavy Duty Safety Boots Waterproof Chemical Proof', 'Safety Footwear', 'AP Boots', 'Surabaya, Indonesia', 'High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer', 'High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC', 'Soft Toe', 'High-Cut / Knee-High', 'Black, Yellow, Green, White', 'EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)', 'Waterproof, Oil Resistant, Chemical Proof, Anti-Slip, Heavy Duty, Anti-Static', 'Oil & Gas Refinery, Petrochemical Plant, Offshore Drilling, Fuel Terminal', 'oil gas safety boots', 'refinery protective wellingtons', 'chemical resistant rubber boots', 'waterproof oil gas refinery boots, heavy duty safety wellingtons surabaya, chemical proof industrial boots, anti slip refinery footwear', 60, 9.77, 8.07, 6.8, 12, '60 x 40 x 40 cm', 12.0, 0.096, 'Surabaya, Indonesia', '7 - 14 Days', '<div class="product-description-container">\n<h2>AP Boots 2017 GREEN LIME Oil Gas Refinery Heavy Duty Safety Boots Waterproof Chemical Proof</h2>\n<p><strong>Product Purpose & Overview:</strong> Engineered specifically for hazardous oil refineries, petrochemical processing plants, and offshore drilling platforms. Provides high-grade chemical resistance against hydrocarbons and oil slick hazards with high-traction slip resistance.</p>\n<h3>Key Features & Industry Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Application Focus:</strong> Specifically tailored for Oil & Gas Refinery, Petrochemical Plant, Offshore Drilling, Fuel Terminal.</li>\n    <li><strong>Material & Construction:</strong> Molded from High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer using seamless single-injection technology to guarantee 100% leak-proof reliability.</li>\n    <li><strong>Safety & Outsole:</strong> Features High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC with Waterproof, Oil Resistant, Chemical Proof, Anti-Slip, Heavy Duty, Anti-Static.</li>\n    <li><strong>Toe Protection:</strong> Equipped with Soft Toe for safety against physical hazards.</li>\n