('1216', 'APB-GR-06-V6', 'APB-GR-06', '2017 GREEN LIME', '6', 'Medical & Kitchen Hygiene', 'AP Boots 2017 GREEN LIME Hospital Kitchen Food Grade Clogs Medical Safety Footwear', 'Safety Footwear', 'AP Boots', 'Surabaya, Indonesia', 'High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer', 'High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC', 'Soft Toe', 'High-Cut / Knee-High', 'Black, Yellow, Green, White', 'EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)', 'HACCP Compliant, Sanitized Antimicrobial, Autoclavable, Anti-Static, Lightweight', 'Hospital Operating Room, Medical Lab, Commercial Kitchen, Food Processing', 'food grade medical clogs', 'hospital anti static boots', 'commercial kitchen footwear', 'haccp certified chef shoes, medical lab protective clogs, autoclavable hospital footwear, hygienic food processing clogs', 60, 9.77, 8.07, 6.8, 12, '60 x 40 x 40 cm', 12.0, 0.096, 'Surabaya, Indonesia', '7 - 14 Days', '<div class="product-description-container">\n<h2>AP Boots 2017 GREEN LIME Hospital Kitchen Food Grade Clogs Medical Safety Footwear</h2>\n<p><strong>Product Purpose & Overview:</strong> Engineered for strict biosecurity in hospital operating rooms, laboratories, pharmaceutical cleanrooms, and commercial kitchens. Seamless hygienic molding with antimicrobial protection to inhibit bacterial growth and allow easy sterilization.</p>\n<h3>Key Features & Industry Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Application Focus:</strong> Specifically tailored for Hospital Operating Room, Medical Lab, Commercial Kitchen, Food Processing.</li>\n    <li><strong>Material & Construction:</strong> Molded from High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer using seamless single-injection technology to guarantee 100% leak-proof reliability.</li>\n    <li><strong>Safety & Outsole:</strong> Features High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC with HACCP Compliant, Sanitized Antimicrobial, Autoclavable, Anti-Static, Lightweight.</li>\n    <li><strong>Toe Protection:</strong> Equipped with Soft Toe for safety against physical hazards.</li>\n    <li><strong>Hygie