('1297', 'APB-95-01-V7', 'APB-95-01', '9506 GREEN', '7', 'Motorcycle & Courier', 'AP Boots 9506 GREEN Motorcycle Biker Logistics Protective Boots Waterproof Ankle Guard', 'Safety Footwear', 'AP Boots', 'Surabaya, Indonesia', 'High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer', 'High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC', 'Soft Toe', 'Mid-Calf', 'Black, Yellow, Green, White', 'EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)', 'Ankle Armor Guard, Shifter Pad Protection, High Visibility, Waterproof, Anti-Slip', 'Motorcycle Express Courier, SPBU Gas Station Patrol, Mobile Logistics, Biker Safety', 'motorcycle protective boots', 'biker rain wellingtons', 'express courier safety boots', 'motorcycle delivery boots waterproof, spbu station attendant boots, gear shifter guard biker boots, anti slip motorcycle wellingtons', 60, 9.2, 7.6, 6.4, 12, '60 x 40 x 40 cm', 18.5, 0.096, 'Surabaya, Indonesia', '7 - 14 Days', '<div class="product-description-container">\n<h2>AP Boots 9506 GREEN Motorcycle Biker Logistics Protective Boots Waterproof Ankle Guard</h2>\n<p><strong>Product Purpose & Overview:</strong> Tailored for motorcycle delivery couriers, express logistics riders, and gas station patrol staff. Features protective lateral ankle padding, gear-shifter guard, and high-grip outsole for stopping safely on wet or oil-slicked asphalt.</p>\n<h3>Key Features & Industry Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Application Focus:</strong> Specifically tailored for Motorcycle Express Courier, SPBU Gas Station Patrol, Mobile Logistics, Biker Safety.</li>\n    <li><strong>Material & Construction:</strong> Molded from High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer using seamless single-injection technology to guarantee 100% leak-proof reliability.</li>\n    <li><strong>Safety & Outsole:</strong> Features High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC with Ankle Armor Guard, Shifter Pad Protection, High Visibility, Waterproof, Anti-Slip.</li>\n    <li><strong>Toe Protection:</strong> Equipped with Soft Toe for safety against physical hazards.</li>\n    <li><st