('1353', 'APB-15-04-V3', 'APB-15-04', '2015 BLACK', '3', 'Mining & Quarrying', 'AP Boots 2015 BLACK Mining Quarry Industrial Rubber Boots Heavy Duty Abrasion Proof', 'Safety Footwear', 'AP Boots', 'Surabaya, Indonesia', 'High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer', 'High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC', 'Soft Toe', 'Mid-Calf', 'Black, Yellow, Green, White', 'EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)', 'Waterproof, Extreme Durability, Abrasion Resistant, Deep Cleats, Puncture Resistant', 'Open Pit Mining, Underground Quarry, Heavy Earthmoving, Mineral Processing', 'mining safety boots', 'quarry rubber wellingtons', 'heavy duty mining boots', 'abrasion resistant mining boots, open pit mining footwear, deep cleat rubber wellingtons, industrial quarry boots supplier', 60, 9.77, 8.07, 6.8, 12, '60 x 40 x 40 cm', 18.5, 0.096, 'Surabaya, Indonesia', '7 - 14 Days', '<div class="product-description-container">\n<h2>AP Boots 2015 BLACK Mining Quarry Industrial Rubber Boots Heavy Duty Abrasion Proof</h2>\n<p><strong>Product Purpose & Overview:</strong> Specially formulated for high-abrasion mining operations, rock quarries, and mineral processing sites. Thick specialized PVC/rubber compound resists cuts, sharp gravel punctures, and harsh outdoor field conditions.</p>\n<h3>Key Features & Industry Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Application Focus:</strong> Specifically tailored for Open Pit Mining, Underground Quarry, Heavy Earthmoving, Mineral Processing.</li>\n    <li><strong>Material & Construction:</strong> Molded from High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer using seamless single-injection technology to guarantee 100% leak-proof reliability.</li>\n    <li><strong>Safety & Outsole:</strong> Features High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC with Waterproof, Extreme Durability, Abrasion Resistant, Deep Cleats, Puncture Resistant.</li>\n    <li><strong>Toe Protection:</strong> Equipped with Soft Toe for safety against physical hazards.</li>\n    <li><strong>Hygiene & Comfort:</strong> Ergonomic inner contour red