('1402', 'APB-MD-01-V2', 'APB-MD-01', 'AP MEDIC BLUE/GREEN/WHITE', '2', 'Civil Construction', 'AP Boots AP MEDIC BLUE/GREEN/WHITE Construction Site Safety Boots Impact Resistant Heavy Duty', 'nan', 'AP Boots', 'Surabaya, Indonesia', 'High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer', 'High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC', 'Soft Toe', 'Mid-Calf', 'Black, Yellow, Green, White', 'EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)', 'Waterproof, Impact Resistant, Puncture Protection, High Traction, All-Weather', 'Heavy Civil Construction, Road Paving, Building Infrastructure, Excavation', 'construction safety boots', 'heavy duty site wellingtons', 'puncture proof work boots', 'civil engineering safety boots, road construction wellingtons, high traction site boots, waterproof construction footwear indonesia', 60, 20.7, 17.1, 14.4, 12, '60 x 40 x 40 cm', 18.5, 0.096, 'Surabaya, Indonesia', '7 - 14 Days', '<div class="product-description-container">\n<h2>AP Boots AP MEDIC BLUE/GREEN/WHITE Construction Site Safety Boots Impact Resistant Heavy Duty</h2>\n<p><strong>Product Purpose & Overview:</strong> Built for rugged heavy civil construction sites, road paving, and excavation projects. Constructed with superior impact protection, high-tensile structure, and deep tread outsole to prevent slips on loose soil and wet concrete.</p>\n<h3>Key Features & Industry Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Application Focus:</strong> Specifically tailored for Heavy Civil Construction, Road Paving, Building Infrastructure, Excavation.</li>\n    <li><strong>Material & Construction:</strong> Molded from High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer using seamless single-injection technology to guarantee 100% leak-proof reliability.</li>\n    <li><strong>Safety & Outsole:</strong> Features High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC with Waterproof, Impact Resistant, Puncture Protection, High Traction, All-Weather.</li>\n    <li><strong>Toe Protection:</strong> Equipped with Soft Toe for safety against physical hazards.</li>\n    <li><strong>Hygiene & C