>\n    <li><strong>Hygiene & Comfort:</strong> Ergonomic inner contour reduces foot fatigue during long work shifts. Easy to rinse and clean.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Technical Specifications:</h3>\n<table border="1" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;">\n    <tr><td><strong>Brand Name</strong></td><td>AP Boots (PT Waru Gunung Industry)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Model Number / SKU</strong></td><td>APB-TC-05-V7 (Base: APB-TC-05)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Place of Origin</strong></td><td>Surabaya, Indonesia</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Upper Material</strong></td><td>High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Outsole Material</strong></td><td>High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Toe Style</strong></td><td>Soft Toe</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Boot Height</strong></td><td>Mid-Calf</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Available Colors</strong></td><td>Black, Yellow, Green, White</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Size Range</strong></td><td>EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Primary Application</strong></td><td>Motorcycle Express Courier, SPBU Gas Station Patrol, Mobile Logistics, Biker Safety</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Packaging & Logistics Data:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>MOQ (Minimum Order):</strong> 5 Master Cartons (60 Pairs)</li>\n    <li><strong>Packaging:</strong> 12 Pairs per Master Carton Box (60 x 40 x 40 cm)</li>\n    <li><strong>Gross Weight:</strong> Approx. 18.5 kg per carton box</li>\n    <li><strong>Volume:</strong> 0.096 CBM per carton box</li>\n    <li><strong>Port of Loading:</strong> Tanjung Perak, Surabaya / Tanjung Priok, Jakarta</li>\n    <li><strong>Lead Time:</strong> 7 - 14 Business Days</li>\n</ul>\n</div>', 'https://p16-images-sign-sg.tokopedia-static.net/tos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg/96fc5a10eddd4130b6eaf1fa73efffe3~tplv-aphluv4xwc-white-pad-v1:1600:1600.jpeg', 'https://p16-images-sign-sg.tokopedia-static.net/tos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg/96fc5a10eddd4130b6eaf1fa7