('1448', 'APB-TC-05-V8', 'APB-TC-05', 'TERRA ECO 5 GR', '8', 'Chemical & Factory Manufacturing', 'AP Boots TERRA ECO 5 GR Chemical Plant Factory Industrial Boots Acid Alkali Proof', 'Safety Footwear', 'AP Boots', 'Surabaya, Indonesia', 'High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer', 'High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC', 'Soft Toe', 'Mid-Calf', 'Black, Yellow, Green, White', 'EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)', 'Corrosion Resistant, Acid & Alkali Proof, Shock Absorption, Durable, Oil Resistant', 'Chemical Manufacturing Plant, Industrial Assembly Line, Warehouse Logistics', 'chemical plant safety boots', 'industrial factory wellingtons', 'acid resistant rubber boots', 'chemical handling protective boots, factory assembly line wellingtons, shock absorbing industrial boots, alkali proof pvc safety footwear', 60, 5.75, 4.75, 4.0, 12, '60 x 40 x 40 cm', 18.5, 0.096, 'Surabaya, Indonesia', '7 - 14 Days', '<div class="product-description-container">\n<h2>AP Boots TERRA ECO 5 GR Chemical Plant Factory Industrial Boots Acid Alkali Proof</h2>\n<p><strong>Product Purpose & Overview:</strong> Designed for chemical manufacturing facilities, industrial assembly plants, and heavy warehouses. Offers high resistance to mild acids, alkalis, industrial solvents, and detergents with a shock-absorbing heel cushion for all-day shifts.</p>\n<h3>Key Features & Industry Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Application Focus:</strong> Specifically tailored for Chemical Manufacturing Plant, Industrial Assembly Line, Warehouse Logistics.</li>\n    <li><strong>Material & Construction:</strong> Molded from High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer using seamless single-injection technology to guarantee 100% leak-proof reliability.</li>\n    <li><strong>Safety & Outsole:</strong> Features High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC with Corrosion Resistant, Acid & Alkali Proof, Shock Absorption, Durable, Oil Resistant.</li>\n    <li><strong>Toe Protection:</strong> Equipped with Soft Toe for safety against physical hazards.</li>\n   