('1552', 'APB-OR-01-V2', 'APB-OR-01', 'ORCA GR', '2', 'Civil Construction', 'AP Boots ORCA GR Construction Site Safety Boots Impact Resistant Heavy Duty', 'Safety Footwear', 'AP Boots', 'Surabaya, Indonesia', 'High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer', 'High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC', 'Soft Toe', 'Mid-Calf', 'Black, Yellow, Green, White', 'EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)', 'Waterproof, Impact Resistant, Puncture Protection, High Traction, All-Weather', 'Heavy Civil Construction, Road Paving, Building Infrastructure, Excavation', 'construction safety boots', 'heavy duty site wellingtons', 'puncture proof work boots', 'civil engineering safety boots, road construction wellingtons, high traction site boots, waterproof construction footwear indonesia', 60, 6.9, 5.7, 4.8, 12, '60 x 40 x 40 cm', 18.5, 0.096, 'Surabaya, Indonesia', '7 - 14 Days', '<div class="product-description-container">\n<h2>AP Boots ORCA GR Construction Site Safety Boots Impact Resistant Heavy Duty</h2>\n<p><strong>Product Purpose & Overview:</strong> Built for rugged heavy civil construction sites, road paving, and excavation projects. Constructed with superior impact protection, high-tensile structure, and deep tread outsole to prevent slips on loose soil and wet concrete.</p>\n<h3>Key Features & Industry Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Application Focus:</strong> Specifically tailored for Heavy Civil Construction, Road Paving, Building Infrastructure, Excavation.</li>\n    <li><strong>Material & Construction:</strong> Molded from High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer using seamless single-injection technology to guarantee 100% leak-proof reliability.</li>\n    <li><strong>Safety & Outsole:</strong> Features High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC with Waterproof, Impact Resistant, Puncture Protection, High Traction, All-Weather.</li>\n    <li><strong>Toe Protection:</strong> Equipped with Soft Toe for safety against physical hazards.</li>\n    <li><strong>Hygiene & Comfort:</strong> Ergonomic inner contour reduces foot fatigue during long work shifts. Easy to rinse and clean.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Technical Specifications:</h3>\n<table border="1" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;">\n    <tr><td><strong>Brand Name</strong></td><td>AP Boots (PT Waru Gunung Industry)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Model Number / SKU</strong></td><td>APB-OR-01-V2 (Base: APB-OR-01)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Place of Origin</strong></td><td>Surabaya, Indonesia</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Upper Material</strong></td><td>High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Outsole Material</strong></td><td>High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Toe Style</strong></td><td>Soft Toe</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Boot Height</strong></td><td>Mid-Calf</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Available Colors</strong></td><td>Black, Yellow, Green, White</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Size Range</strong></td><td>EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Primary Application</strong></td><td>Heavy Civil Construction, Road Paving, Building Infrastructure, Excavation</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Packaging & Logistics Data:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>MOQ (Minimum Order):</strong> 5 Master Cartons (60 Pairs)</li>\n    <li><strong>Packaging:</strong> 12 Pairs per Master Carton Box (60 x 40 x 40 cm)</li>\n    <li><strong>Gross Weight:</strong> Approx. 18.5 kg per carton box</li>\n    <li><strong>Volume:</strong> 0.096 CBM per carton box</li>\n    <li><strong>Port of Loading:</strong> Tanjung Perak, Surabaya / Tanjung Priok, Jakarta</li>\n    <li><strong>Lead Time:</strong> 7 - 14 Business Days</li>\n</ul>\n</div>', 'https://hotstrading.com/backend/uploads/photobank/APB-OR-02_ap_boots_orca_realistic_photograph_01_1791538346_849.webp', 'https://hotstrading.com/backend/uploads/photobank/APB-OR-02_ap_boots_orca_realistic_photograph_02_1791538346_769.webp', 'https://hotstrading.com/backend/uploads/photobank/APB-OR-02_ap_boots_orca_rear_view_01_17915383