('1800', 'APB-KD-07-V10', 'APB-KD-07', '2001 ROOT N LEAVES', '10', 'All-Weather Rain Utility', 'AP Boots 2001 ROOT N LEAVES All Weather Rain Outdoor Utility Boots Waterproof Anti Slip', 'Safety Footwear', 'AP Boots', 'Surabaya, Indonesia', 'High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer', 'High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC', 'Soft Toe', 'Mid-Calf', 'Black, Yellow, Green, White', 'EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)', '100% Leak-Proof, Durable Polymer, Easy Cleaning, All Seasons, Flexible', 'General Utility, Municipal Works, Landscaping, Extreme Monsoon Rain Weather', 'all weather rain boots', 'outdoor utility wellingtons', 'waterproof monsoon boots', 'municipal maintenance rain boots, landscaping outdoor wellingtons, durable monsoon rubber boots, all season utility footwear', 60, 5.75, 4.75, 4.0, 12, '60 x 40 x 40 cm', 18.5, 0.096, 'Surabaya, Indonesia', '7 - 14 Days', '<div class="product-description-container">\n<h2>AP Boots 2001 ROOT N LEAVES All Weather Rain Outdoor Utility Boots Waterproof Anti Slip</h2>\n<p><strong>Product Purpose & Overview:</strong> Versatile all-weather utility footwear for municipal maintenance, flood response, landscaping, and outdoor work during heavy monsoon rains. Single-injection molded from premium PVC polymer for maximum longevity and zero seam failure.</p>\n<h3>Key Features & Industry Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Application Focus:</strong> Specifically tailored for General Utility, Municipal Works, Landscaping, Extreme Monsoon Rain Weather.</li>\n    <li><strong>Material & Construction:</strong> Molded from High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer using seamless single-injection technology to guarantee 100% leak-proof reliability.</li>\n    <li><strong>Safety & Outsole:</strong> Features High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC with 100% Leak-Proof, Durable Polymer, Easy Cleaning, All Seasons, Flexible.</li>\n    <li><strong>Toe Protection:</strong> Equipped with Soft Toe for safety against physical hazards.</li>\n    <li><strong>Hygiene & Comfort:</strong> Ergonomic inner contour reduces foot fatigue during long work shifts. Easy to rinse and clean.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Technical Specifications:</h3>\n<table border="1" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;">\n    <tr><td><strong>Brand Name</strong></td><td>AP Boots (PT Waru Gunung Industry)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Model Number / SKU</strong></td><td>APB-KD-07-V10 (Base: APB-KD-07)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Place of Origin</strong></td><td>Surabaya, Indonesia</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Upper Material</strong></td><td>High-Grade PVC / Rubber Polymer</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Outsole Material</strong></td><td>High-Traction Anti-Slip PVC</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Toe Style</strong></td><td>Soft Toe</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Boot Height</strong></td><td>Mid-Calf</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Available Colors</strong></td><td>Black, Yellow, Green, White</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Size Range</strong></td><td>EU 38 - 43 (Selected variants EU 39 - 45)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Primary Application</strong></td><td>General Utility, Municipal Works, Landscaping, Extreme Monsoon Rain Weather</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Packaging & Logistics Data:</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>MOQ (Minimum Order):</strong> 5 Master Cartons (60 Pairs)</li>\n    <li><strong>Packaging:</strong> 12 Pairs per Master Carton Box (60 x 40 x 40 cm)</li>\n    <li><strong>Gross Weight:</strong> Approx. 18.5 kg per carton box</li>\n    <li><strong>Volume:</strong> 0.096 CBM per carton box</li>\n    <li><strong>Port of Loading:</strong> Tanjung Perak, Surabaya / Tanjung Priok, Jakarta</li>\n    <li><strong>Lead Time:</strong> 7 - 14 Business Days</li>\n</ul>\n</div>', 'https://p16-images-common-sign-sg.tokopedia-static.net/tos-maliva-i-o3syd03w52-us/3fc76194fa5749089269555109388e49~tplv-aphluv4xwc-resize-jpeg:1600:1600.jpeg', 'https://p16-images-common-sign-sg.tokopedia-static.net/tos-maliva-i-o3syd03w52-us/ae389c9c030847b8979a0de109e48167~tplv-aphluv4xwc-resize-jpeg:160